      "grounded_in": "Ship a self-serve API key management portal for enterprise customers by end of Q2. Customers will be able to create, rotate, and revoke API keys without contacting support.",
      "objection": "Enterprise customers — particularly those whose procurement triggered the manual provisioning process in the first place — commonly operate under security policies that require IT or InfoSec approval before any credential is provisioned, regardless of what the vendor's portal allows.",
