      "challenge": "The proposal acknowledges no function for the solutions team beyond creating delay. If that team has been quietly resolving scope misconfigurations, flagging suspicious onboarding patterns, or converting provisioning calls into upsell conversations, eliminating their touchpoint removes those functions silently. The metric 'zero manual provisioning tickets' would read as green even if downstream consequences — misconfigured integrations, security incidents, or missed expansion revenue — were actively accumulating. The risk section addresses credential sharing but does not address this category of loss at all."
